msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we release Quarkus 2.1.0.Final which includes a lot of refinements "
"and improvements and a couple of new features:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Dev Service for Keycloak"
msgstr ""

msgid "Reactive Microsoft SQL Server extension"
msgstr ""

msgid "Upgrade to Kotlin 1.5"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To migrate from 2.0, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"wiki/Migration-Guide-2.1[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Dev Services start the required containers automatically when you are "
"developing or testing your application."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A lot of Quarkus extensions are already covered and, in 2.1, we added link:/"
"guides/security-openid-connect-dev-services[a Dev Service for Keycloak]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"2.1 adds a reactive driver extension for Microsoft SQL Server - `quarkus-"
"reactive-mssql-client`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Kotlin 1.5"
msgstr ""

msgid "We upgraded our Kotlin extension and tooling to 1.5, namely 1.5.21."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full Changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelogs of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.1.0.CR1[2.1.0.CR1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.1.0.Final[2.1.0.Final] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

